{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ponchyo: A Platypus Adventure</strong> is a charming 3D platformer collectathon full of adventure - and a little touch of nostalgia! Step into the shoes (Wait... platypuses don't have shoes, right? No idea!) of Ponchyo the platypus and travel through a variety of worlds. Collect coins and discover new furniture to decorate your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect coins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/b62361df2a921ca947689839acffcd68.poster.avif?t=1760568983\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/b62361df2a921ca947689839acffcd68.webm?t=1760568983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/b62361df2a921ca947689839acffcd68.mp4?t=1760568983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more coins you collect, the more worlds you can unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uh-oh, enemies ahead!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/5c5f7fa01117e03658754448b8b4fab5.poster.avif?t=1760568983\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/5c5f7fa01117e03658754448b8b4fab5.webm?t=1760568983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will try to stop you on your journey! Take them down before they deal damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges await!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/4b6643fa98c302acf370eaf13844067c.poster.avif?t=1760568983\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/4b6643fa98c302acf370eaf13844067c.webm?t=1760568983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/4b6643fa98c302acf370eaf13844067c.mp4?t=1760568983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course there are some challenges and mini-games - come on, it\u2019s a collectathon! What did you expect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/69fe7ea49eb2874c27b94aef6a2b093f.poster.avif?t=1760568983\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/69fe7ea49eb2874c27b94aef6a2b093f.webm?t=1760568983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find brand-new furniture for your home! Every piece you collect gets placed in your house in the hub world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades for your platypus!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/22cc52b73333b506d9ee20c713e98df2.poster.avif?t=1760568983\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/extras/22cc52b73333b506d9ee20c713e98df2.webm?t=1760568983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In what world would we live without upgrades? Find several upgrades to unlock new abilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801590?t=1760568983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/1638ecb37a8d02ade783dfff182cb7e0ee55f81f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760568983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/b3eaf59fb01db985f94c951f2efb8ef9eb8107e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760568983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801590/b3eaf59fb01db985f94c951f2efb8ef9eb8107e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760568983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3859050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ponchyo: A Platypus Adventure</strong> is a charming 3D platformer collectathon full of adventure - and a little touch of nostalgia! Step into the shoes (Wait... platypuses don't have shoes, right? No idea!) of Ponchyo the platypus and travel through a variety of worlds. Collect coins and discover new furniture to decorate your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect coins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c